                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Space-oriented dynamic modeling <a href="/record/ui?ui=D000465" class="textLink_ALGORITHMS">ALGORITHMS</a> acting in an array of cells, whose temporal states evolve based on the rules (algorithms) of the automata. They are used to model complex dynamic systems for study and analysis in a variety of scientific fields.</dd>
                </span>
            
